{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45545","headline":"怀庐山旧隐 · 若虚","name":"怀庐山旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九叠嵯峨倚着天，悔随寒瀑下岩烟。\n深秋猨鸟来心上，夜静松杉到眼前。\n书架想遭苔藓[裹]，石窗应被薜萝缠。\n一枝筇竹游江北，不见炉峰二十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}